lta la claridad de los medios y aplica un corte en los bajos para controlar el efecto de proximidad. Es mundialmente famoso por su construcci\u00f3n extremadamente robusta y su sistema de montura antivibraci\u00f3n neum\u00e1tica, que reduce dr\u00e1sticamente el ruido de manejo.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">La denominaci\u00f3n <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">\u00abLC\u00bb<\/b> (Less Cable) indica que esta versi\u00f3n se comercializa de f\u00e1brica sin cable incluido, permitiendo al usuario seleccionar el cableado de su preferencia. Su rejilla de acero esf\u00e9rica act\u00faa como un filtro antipop y antiviento de alta eficacia, protegiendo la c\u00e1psula incluso en las condiciones m\u00e1s exigentes.<\/p>\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"6\" \/>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Caracter\u00edsticas T\u00e9cnicas<\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tipo de Micr\u00f3fono:<\/b> Din\u00e1mico (no requiere alimentaci\u00f3n Phantom).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Patr\u00f3n Polar:<\/b> <b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">Cardioide<\/b> (sim\u00e9trico respecto al eje del micr\u00f3fono para m\u00e1ximo rechazo de sonido posterior).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Respuesta de Frecuencia:<\/b> <b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"25\">50 Hz \u2013 15,000 Hz<\/b>, con realce de presencia en frecuencias medias.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Estructura:<\/b> Cuerpo de metal fundido a presi\u00f3n, acabado en gris oscuro esmaltado.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rejilla:<\/b> Esf\u00e9rica de malla de acero reforzado.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Conector:<\/b> XLR macho de 3 pines profesional.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"32740000","regular_price":"32740000","sale_price":"32740000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"ARS","currency_symbol":"$","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"$","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#036;<\/span>327.400,00<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20279,"src":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-430x430.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1.png 1080w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-430x430.png 430w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-700x700.png 700w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-800x800.png 800w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-860x860.png 860w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-64x64.png 64w","sizes":"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/MICROFONO-SM58-LC-SHURE-1-430x430.png 430w, https:\/\/hendrix.com.ar\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/1